<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Terms of Service — <%= botName %></title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#0b0f17;
    --bg-elevated:#121a2b;
    --line:#22304a;
    --text:#eaf0ff;
    --muted:#8593ad;
    --strand-a:#34e5b5;
    --strand-b:#7c6cf6;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:64px 24px 100px;
  }
  .card{ max-width:640px; width:100%; }
  .helix-mini{ width:64px; margin-bottom:24px; opacity:0.7; }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:0.08em;
    color:var(--strand-a);
    margin:0 0 14px;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,38px);
    margin:0 0 12px;
  }
  .updated{
    display:inline-block;
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    font-size:12px;
    color:var(--muted);
    background:var(--bg-elevated);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:6px 12px;
    border-radius:999px;
    margin-bottom:32px;
  }
  ol{ padding-left:20px; margin:0 0 24px; }
  ol li{
    color:#c4cde0;
    line-height:1.75;
    font-size:16px;
    margin-bottom:12px;
  }
  ol li::marker{
    font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
    color:var(--strand-b);
    font-size:14px;
  }
  p.body-text{
    color:#c4cde0;
    line-height:1.75;
    font-size:16px;
    margin:0 0 20px;
  }
  a.inline{
    color:var(--strand-a);
    text-decoration:none;
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(52,229,181,0.4);
  }
  a.inline:hover{ border-color:var(--strand-a); }
  .divider{
    border:none;
    height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--strand-a),var(--line) 60%);
    margin:36px 0 28px;
    max-width:180px;
  }
  .back{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:14px;
    color:var(--text);
    text-decoration:none;
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
  }
  .back:hover{ color:var(--strand-a); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <svg class="helix-mini" viewBox="0 0 60 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M50,0 C50,20 10,20 10,40 C10,60 50,60 50,80 C50,100 10,100 10,120" stroke="#34e5b5" stroke-width="3"/>
      <path d="M10,0 C10,20 50,20 50,40 C50,60 10,60 10,80 C10,100 50,100 50,120" stroke="#7c6cf6" stroke-width="3"/>
      <line x1="20" y1="20" x2="40" y2="20" stroke="#3a4a6b" stroke-width="2"/>
      <line x1="20" y1="60" x2="40" y2="60" stroke="#3a4a6b" stroke-width="2"/>
      <line x1="20" y1="100" x2="40" y2="100" stroke="#3a4a6b" stroke-width="2"/>
    </svg>

    <p class="eyebrow">// TERMS OF SERVICE</p>
    <h1>The rules of the bot</h1>
    <span class="updated">Last updated <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString() %></span>

    <ol>
      <li>This bot is for personal and educational purposes only.</li>
      <li>Do not use this bot to share harmful, illegal, or inappropriate content.</li>
      <li>Responses are generated by AI and may not always be accurate.</li>
      <li>We may store limited usage data to improve bot functionality and enforce limits.</li>
      <li>By using this bot, you agree to these terms.</li>
    </ol>

    <p class="body-text">For more info, contact us via our <a href="<%= supportLink %>" class="inline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Telegram support</a>.</p>

    <hr class="divider">
    <a href="/" class="back">&larr; Back to home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
